s whether silent failures are a security feature or a hole, because Babshaggoth and Barnaby are talking past each other and the codebase should arbitrate. That's the show, folks — next episode we're not theorizing, we're reading traces." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.aistudio.purpclaw.osv7" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[102,219][1157,2451]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="P" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.aistudio.purpclaw.osv7" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1291,185][1341,320]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.aistudio.purpclaw.osv7" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,2451][1440,2940]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.EditText" package="com.aistudio.purpclaw.osv7" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[38,2489][1402,2744]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="● THINKING" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.aistudio.purpclaw.osv7" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[98,2549][495,2684]" drawing-o